#error "validated generated BF16 x FP4 device source has not been installed"

#define FLASHINFER_BLACKWELL_BF16_FP4_SOURCE_READY 0

#include "blackwell_bf16_fp4_host.cuh"

// The populated translation unit owns all device variants plus one TVM-FFI
// entry named blackwell_bf16_fp4_generated. The entry accepts activation,
// backend-prepared weight and scale tensors, alpha carrier, output, backend
// id, alpha-present flag, and PDL flag. It must validate shapes and layouts,
// encode tensor maps, obtain immutable cached descriptor slots, select the
// exact alpha/output/PDL variant, choose the full-TMA or pointer-load route
// from the reduction alignment, opt into dynamic shared memory, and launch on
// the TVM-FFI environment stream. The cuDNN-prepared route keeps arbitrary
// positive N and K divisible by 16; the packed route additionally requires N
// divisible by 64.
